# 🎓 VERY IMPORTANT VIVA (HIGH CHANCE)

**Q: Why NAT Gateway is used?**

> NAT Gateway allows private instances to access the internet without exposing them to public internet.

**Q: Difference IGW vs NAT?**

> IGW provides direct internet access, NAT provides outbound internet only for private subnet.

